# Git Push

## Directives

- Commit current-change work through Guide skill `git-commit` before pushing.
- If other changed files may not belong to this change, consult the user before
  proceeding. Ask whether to include them or leave them uncommitted.
- For approved additions, use Guide skill `git-commit` again before pushing.
- Push only the resulting selected commits using the selected delivery policy.

